    "details": "Memory safety bugs present in firefox-esr 140.6, Thunderbird ESR 140.6,\nFirefox 146 and Thunderbird 146.\n\nSpoofing issue in the DOM: Copy & Paste and Drag & Drop component.\n\nClickjacking issue and information disclosure in the PDF Viewer\ncomponent.\n\nUse-after-free in the JavaScript: GC component.\n\nUse-after-free in the JavaScript Engine component.\n\nInformation disclosure in the Networking component.\n\nSandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics:\nCanvasWebGL component.\n",
